th=\"631\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">One or more of the following also strongly expressed: CD10, CD22, CD79a<sup>c</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"47\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 473.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"631\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"47\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD19 weak<sup>b</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 473.2pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"631\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Two or more of the following also strongly expressed: CD10, CD22, CD79a<sup>c</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 7cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"265\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">T&nbsp;lineage</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 473.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"631\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"47\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD3 (cytoplasmic or surface)<sup>d</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 473.2pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"631\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Intensity in part exceeds 50% of that of mature T&nbsp;cells by flow cytometry</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Immunocytochemistry positive with non&ndash;&zeta;-chain reagent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 7cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"265\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Myeloid lineage</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 473.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"631\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"47\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Myeloperoxidase</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 473.2pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"631\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Intensity in part exceeds 50% of mature neutrophil level</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"47\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 473.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"631\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.45pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"47\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Monocytic differentiation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 473.2pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"631\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Two or more of the following expressed: nonspecific esterase, CD11c, CD14, CD64, lysozyme</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><sup><span lang=\"EN-GB\">a</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD19</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> intensity in part exceeds 50% of that of normal B-cell progenitor by flow cytometry. <sup>b</sup>CD19 intensity does not exceed 50% of that of normal B-cell progenitor by flow cytometry. <sup>c</sup>Provided T&nbsp;lineage is not under consideration; if it is, CD79a cannot be used. <sup>d</sup>Using CD3 epsilon-chain antibody.</span></p>",
